Planning an outdoor wedding in Malaga means planning around no walls, no ceiling and, at most fincas and villas, a curfew on amplified sound. Malaga Event Gear's [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) covers the audio visual slice of that: PA sound, ambient lighting, wireless microphones and a live technician who sizes and times the system around what your venue allows. It does not cover tents, generators, furniture, decor or venue permits. For the full picture of what we cover for weddings, see our [wedding rentals](/blog/wedding-rentals/) overview.

## Brief Overview

---

An outdoor wedding raises AV specific questions a ballroom never does: does the venue have enough power, how loud can the reception run before a curfew kicks in, and where do speaker and lighting stands go on grass, sand or a windy terrace. The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) answers those with a PA system sized for up to 80 guests, fairy light and warm LED ambient lighting, wireless microphones and a live technician on site, for 650 euros ex VAT.

