## What MEG Covers Outdoors, and What It Doesn't

An outdoor wedding checklist usually spans tents, seating, catering equipment, decor and AV, each its own trade. MEG supplies only the last one: sound, lighting, microphones and, on the Wedding Pack, a live technician. Tents, furniture, decor and venue permits need their own vendor or come bundled into your venue's own hire, common at fincas and villas around Malaga. Our [essential items for wedding rentals](/blog/essential-items-for-wedding-rentals/) guide covers that full list and where AV fits among it.

